&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-4428&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;lie&quot;&gt;Michaels 博士沒有處於危險之中。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;作者：&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/henzoid&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5190300&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606138015&quot; alt=&quot;Henzoid&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5190300)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/henzoid&quot;  &gt;Henzoid&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;与&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lt-flops&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1735419&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606138015&quot; alt=&quot;Lt Flops&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1735419)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lt-flops&quot;  &gt;Lt Flops&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
