						 <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/nav%3Aside/styleFrame.html?bhl" style="display: none;" name="typeFrame"></iframe></p> <div> <div style="float:left;margin-top: -1rem;"> <p><a name="top"></a> [ <a href="#bottom">▽ 直达底部</a> ]</p> </div> <div style="float:right;"></div> </div> <div style="clear:both; height: 0px; font-size: 1px"></div> <div class="phone"> <div class="shelf-1 shelf-wrap trans-yes my-plank-{$my-plank}"> <div class="shelf-yes"></div> <div class="et-plank-wrap"> <div class="et-plank"> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p><br /></p> <p><a name="cover"></a></p> <div id="wiki-tabview-b2079363a92643e8d40ba0cc83337f20" class="yui-navset"> <ul class="yui-nav"> <li class="selected"><a href="javascript:;"><em>封面</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>系列典籍</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>太初以降</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>元始祖劫</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>开辟海托世</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>第二海托世</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>诸神黄昏</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>上古秘史</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>无人采薇</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>先秦遗事</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>走马千年</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>昨日风云</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>还看今朝</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>封底</em></a></li> </ul> <div class="yui-content"> <div id="wiki-tab-0-0"> <div class="box-txt-cover" style="text-align:center;font-size:200%;color:#3f5b15"> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wdfiles.com/local--files/etinjat-2/Liber.jpg" width="200px" alt="Liber.jpg" class="image" /></div> <p><strong>十方大梦溶朝露</strong><br /> <strong>亿世劫灰沦太渊</strong></p> <p><br /></p> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-1" style="display:none"> <div class="box-txt"> <div